    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うわ、まっくら！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa, it's pitch black!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>この水路をたどっていけば
地上にたどりつけるはずだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If we follow this waterway,then it
should bring us to the surface.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ホントにこの先が出口なのか？
なんにも見えねえじゃねえか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is there really an exit up ahead?
I can't see a bloody thing, can you?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あわてるな
燭台に火を灯せば
先が見えるようになる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't panic.
We'll be able to see where we're going
if we light a candlestick.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>さ、行くぞ
せいぜい遅れないように
ついて来い</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's get going.
Follow me if you don't want
to spend the night down here.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>へっ！　そっちこそ
足手まといになんなよ
自信家の兄ちゃん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh! Better make sure that you pull your
weight then, oh fearless leader!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>まっくらになりました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's all gone dark.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
